SUMMARY:Arrive Tokyo — Shinkansen from Kyoto\, drop bags
LOCATION:Shinjuku / Kabukicho\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:~2h15 Nozomi Kyoto -> Tokyo Station\, then ~15 min to Shinjuku 
 (JR Chuo Rapid or Yamanote).\nDrop bags at the apartment\, then an orienta
 tion walk through Kabukicho past the Godzilla head.\nMap: https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shinjuku+Station+Tokyo
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Arrive Tokyo — Shinkansen from Kyoto\, drop bags
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
