SUMMARY:Dinner: Omoide Yokocho
LOCATION:1 Chome Nishishinjuku\, Shinjuku City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: charcoal yakitori & grilled offal at tiny standing/c
 ounter stalls.\nLantern-lit alley 5 min from Shinjuku West Exit. No reserv
 ations - walk the lane and grab stools.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/
 search/?api=1&query=Omoide+Yokocho+Shinjuku
