SUMMARY:OPTIONAL: Golden Gai (start at Albatross)
LOCATION:1 Chome Kabukicho\, Shinjuku City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:~200 micro-bars across six alleys\; liveliest after 20:00.\nAlb
 atross: 3 floors\, chandelier-lit\, foreigner-friendly\, ¥500 cover with 
 a snack - good first-night pick.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/
 ?api=1&query=Golden+Gai+Shinjuku
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:OPTIONAL: Golden Gai (start at Albatross)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
