SUMMARY:Meiji Jingu
LOCATION:1-1 Yoyogikamizonocho\, Shibuya City\, Tokyo 151-8557
DESCRIPTION:Free. Opens at sunrise (~06:20 in Nov)\, closes ~16:20.\nTokyo'
 s grandest shrine in a forest of 100\,000 donated trees. Go early for empt
 y gravel approaches.\nRoute: Shinjuku -> Harajuku\, 2 stops / ~4 min on th
 e Yamanote.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Meiji+Ji
 ngu+Tokyo
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Meiji Jingu
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
