SUMMARY:Takeshita-dori + Cat Street (Harajuku)
LOCATION:Takeshita St\, Jingumae\, Shibuya City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:Takeshita's teen-fashion gauntlet\, then the calmer Ura-Harajuk
 u back lanes for streetwear & vintage.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/s
 earch/?api=1&query=Takeshita+Street+Harajuku
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Takeshita-dori + Cat Street (Harajuku)
