SUMMARY:Lunch: Fuunji (tsukemen)
LOCATION:2-14-3 Yoyogi\, Shibuya City\, Tokyo 151-0053
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: chicken-and-niboshi (dried sardine) tsukemen. Large 
 noodle size free.\nAmong Tokyo's best tsukemen\; huge queue by noon - arri
 ve before 11:00 or after 14:00. Cash-friendly\, tiny counter.\nMap: https:
 //www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fuunji+Tokyo+tsukemen
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lunch: Fuunji (tsukemen)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
