SUMMARY:Shibuya Scramble + Hachiko + Shibuya Sky
LOCATION:Shibuya Scramble Square\, 2-24-12 Shibuya\, Shibuya City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:Shibuya Sky rooftop (229 m): ¥2\,700 before 15:00 / ¥3\,400 f
 rom 15:00. Open 10:00-22:30\, last entry 21:20.\nBOOK a ~15:30-16:00 timed
  slot for daylight -> sunset -> city lights. Slots sell out.\nMap: https:/
 /www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shibuya+Sky+Scramble+Square
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Shibuya Scramble + Hachiko + Shibuya Sky
TRIGGER:-PT30M
