SUMMARY:OPTIONAL: The SG Club
LOCATION:1-7-8 Jinnan\, Shibuya City\, Tokyo 150-0041
DESCRIPTION:Shingo Gokan bar\; 9 consecutive years on Asia's 50 Best Bars.\
 nCasual 'Guzzle' upstairs is walk-in friendly\; 'Sip' speakeasy below is d
 ressier. ~10-15 min walk from Shibuya Station.\nMap: https://www.google.co
 m/maps/search/?api=1&query=The+SG+Club+Shibuya
