SUMMARY:Tsukiji Outer Market
LOCATION:4 Chome Tsukiji\, Chuo City\, Tokyo 104-0045
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: tamagoyaki\, uni\, grilled seafood skewers\, standin
 g sushi. 460+ stalls.\nBest window 08:00-10:00 - half the top stalls sell 
 out by ~11:00. Closed Sundays & scattered Weds (Sat is safe).\nGraze acros
 s several stalls rather than one sit-down meal.\nMap: https://www.google.c
 om/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tsukiji+Outer+Market+Tokyo
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tsukiji Outer Market
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
