SUMMARY:Ginza — flagship stores
LOCATION:Ginza\, Chuo City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:~15-min walk from Tsukiji. Ginza Six\, the Uniqlo & Muji flagsh
 ips (Muji has a bakery)\, Itoya stationery megastore.\nOptional: Imperial 
 Palace East Gardens (free\; open Sat - closed Mon & Fri)\, ~10 min from To
 kyo Station.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ginza+T
 okyo
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Ginza — flagship stores
TRIGGER:-PT30M
