 nu - legendary bartender Hidetsugu Ueno.\nIntimate & world-renowned. RESER
 VATION ADVISED\; cover charge\; dress smart-ish. Do an early casual bite f
 irst.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bar+High+Five+
 Ginza
