LOCATION:2-3-1 Asakusa\, Taito City\, Tokyo 111-0032
DESCRIPTION:Free\; grounds 24h\, main hall 06:30-17:00. Enter via the Kamin
 arimon giant lantern.\nGo before 10:00 to beat the crush. HEAVY-WALKING DA
 Y today (Asakusa + Ameyoko + Akihabara).\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps
 /search/?api=1&query=Senso-ji+Asakusa
