SUMMARY:Lunch: Onigiri Asakusa Yadoroku
LOCATION:3-9-10 Asakusa\, Taito City\, Tokyo 111-0032
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: hand-formed onigiri. Tokyo's oldest onigiri speciali
 st (since 1954)\, Michelin Bib Gourmand.\nTiny counter\, limited hours\, c
 an sell out - arrive early. Alt: Asakusa Imahan for century-old sukiyaki.\
