SUMMARY:Akihabara — Electric Town
LOCATION:Akihabara\, Chiyoda/Taito City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:Multi-floor arcades (GiGO\, Taito Station)\, retro games at Sup
 er Potato\, anime/figures on Chuo-dori.\nChuo-dori is car-free Sun 13:00-1
 7:00 (Oct-Mar). Kanda Myojin shrine is a 7-min walk uphill.\nMap: https://
 www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Akihabara+Electric+Town
