SUMMARY:Odakyu Romancecar: Shinjuku -> Hakone-Yumoto
LOCATION:Odakyu Shinjuku Station\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:Direct limited express\, ~85 min. RESERVE seats (right side C/D
  for Mt Fuji).\nBuy the Hakone Freepass digitally (EMot app / Klook) to sk
 ip the morning queue - it covers the whole loop.\nMap: https://www.google.
 com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Odakyu+Shinjuku+Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Odakyu Romancecar: Shinjuku -> Hakone-Yumoto
