SUMMARY:Hakone loop: Gora / Owakudani / Lake Ashi
LOCATION:Hakone\, Kanagawa
DESCRIPTION:Mountain railway to Gora -> cablecar to Sounzan -> ropeway over
  Owakudani (black eggs) -> pirate ship across Lake Ashi to Moto-Hakone (la
 ke torii).\nPeak autumn foliage in November. Lunch on the loop: soba aroun
 d Gora/Yumoto or the Owakudani black eggs.\nBackup if ropeway is wind/gas-
 closed: substitute buses + Hakone Open-Air Museum (all-weather).\nMap: htt
 ps://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Owakudani+Hakone
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Hakone loop: Gora / Owakudani / Lake Ashi
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
