LOCATION:Nishi-Shinjuku\, Shinjuku City\, Tokyo
DESCRIPTION:All three are SUNDAY-CLOSED\, so a Wednesday works. Benfiddich 
 & Zoetrope are tiny (9-15 seats) - arrive at opening.\nBar Zoetrope: 300+ 
 Japanese whiskies\, from 17:00. 7-10-14 Nishishinjuku.\nBar Benfiddich: fo
 raged-botanical cocktails\, 9 seats\, from 18:00. 1-13-7 Nishishinjuku.\nO
 ptional: New York Bar\, Park Hyatt 52F - cover after 20:00\, smart dress.\
 nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bar+Benfiddich+Nishi
 -Shinjuku
