SUMMARY:teamLab Planets TOKYO (booked slot)
LOCATION:6-1-16 Toyosu\, Koto City\, Tokyo 135-0061
DESCRIPTION:Barefoot\, wade-through digital-art rooms. Open 08:30-22:00\, l
 ast entry 60 min before close.\nTIMED tickets from ¥3\,800\, on sale ~lat
 e-Aug for Nov and SELL OUT - book first. You get wet to the knee: bring sh
 orts/roll-ups.\n~10 min from Shin-Toyosu on the Yurikamome.\nMap: https://
 www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=teamLab+Planets+Toyosu+Tokyo
